## DNS VARIABLES
ROOT_DOMAIN=something.com (required for deployment)
ACM_CERTIFICATE_ARN=arn of acm cert here (required for deployment)

## OTHERS
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://swatking:Simple123@localhost:5432/kardops (required for production and local)
DATABASE_URL_MIGRATIONS=postgresql://swatking:Simple123@localhost:5432/kardops (required for deployment)
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=secret-value-here (required both)
DYNAMO_TABLE_NAME=dynamodb-table-name (required but this is automatically generated in prod)